# 3. Figures

## 3.1. Prepare data for figures
```{r}
morpho_agri_plot <- morpho_agri %>% 
  group_by(id_parcelle,TypeCulture) %>% 
  summarise(across(where(is.numeric), mean, na.rm = TRUE)) %>% 
  select(1,2,3:18)
```


## 3.2. Crop type

### Bruches
```{r}
ggplot(data= morpho_agri_plot) + 
  aes(x= TypeCulture, y = Bruches,fill=TypeCulture) +
  geom_jitter(alpha=0.3,col="indianred1")+
  geom_boxplot(alpha=0.8)+
  scale_fill_manual(values=c("darkgoldenrod2","#458B00","darkorchid4"))+
  labs(x="Crop type", y = "Ab. bruches")+
  theme(axis.text=element_text(size=14),
        axis.title=element_text(size=18))+
  theme(legend.title = element_text(size=18),
        legend.text = element_text(size=14))+ theme(legend.position = "none")+
  stat_compare_means(method = "kruskal.test",
                     label="p",
                     vjust = -0.5)
```

